  "description": "Sliding-log rate-limit algorithm (IRateLimiter) for ConduitSharp. Drops into the plugins\n      directory to replace the built-in fixed-window limiter, which allows up to 2x the nominal\n      rate across a window boundary. Holds the limit across every instant by keeping the timestamp\n      of each permit still inside the window, trading O(maxRequests) memory per active key for the\n      accuracy.",
